      "extract": "arXiv:1712.08953v1 [math.RT] 24 Dec 2017 REPRESENTATIONS OF THE ORIENTED SKEIN CATEGORY JONATHAN BRUNDAN Abstract. The oriented skein category OS(z, t) is a ribbon category which un- derpins the deﬁnition of the HOMFLY-PT invariant of an oriented link, in the same way that the Temperley-Lieb category underpins the Jones polynomial. In this article, we develop its representation theory using a highest weight theory",
